+ ## Architecture Overview — Local vs Cloud Processing
+ **MoltGuard has TWO separate components with different architectures:**
+ ### 1. AI Security Gateway (100% Local)
+ **Purpose:** Sanitize sensitive data before sending to YOUR LLM provider
+ **Architecture:** Runs entirely on `localhost:38790` on your machine
+ **Data flow:**
+ **Data flow:**
+ Your Agent → [Local Gateway: sanitize] → Your LLM Provider → [Local Gateway: restore] → Your Agent
+ **What stays local:** ALL data processing. The gateway never sends data to OpenGuardrails.
+ **What goes to cloud:** Nothing. The gateway only communicates with YOUR LLM provider (Anthropic/OpenAI/Gemini).
+ ### 2. Security Detection (Cloud-Based with Local Sanitization)
+ **Purpose:** Detect prompt injection, malicious commands, and behavioral anomalies
+ **Architecture:** Hybrid — sanitization happens locally, detection happens in OpenGuardrails Cloud
